            "text": "{\"episodes\":[{\"id\":3946240,\"episode_number\":1,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"The Journey's End\",\"overview\":\"The world celebrates the Demon King's defeat at the hands of the Hero and his companions. Now that their great adventure is over, what will Frieren the mage do next?\",\"still_path\":\"/7SfqQVmW125ugsktoRVTnRXpAkd.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-09-29\",\"runtime\":26,\"vote_average\":8.7},{\"id\":4698536,\"episode_number\":2,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"It Didn't Have to Be Magic...\",\"overview\":\"Frieren instructs Fern in the use of magic while deciphering a grimoire for Heiter.\",\"still_path\":\"/jVeDv4dZI5KbRQw3eD8RRiojUZ5.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-09-29\",\"runtime\":26,\"vote_average\":7.7},{\"id\":4698538,\"episode_number\":3,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Killing Magic\",\"overview\":\"While retracing the path she took on her adventure with her former traveling companions, Frieren confronts an old enemy.\",\"still_path\":\"/5uVpkiIoMRCDaLcAxfG8Gc7VJWo.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-09-29\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.286},{\"id\":4698539,\"episode_number\":4,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"The Land Where Souls Rest\",\"overview\":\"Frieren and Fern pay a visit to Eisen, who requests their help in finding the notes of Flamme the Legendary Mage.\",\"still_path\":\"/nYFUXvyrxCRwcOdIiqRdLJtVScj.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-09-29\",\"runtime\":26,\"vote_average\":8.4},{\"id\":4698540,\"episode_number\":5,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Phantoms of the Dead\",\"overview\":\"Frieren and Fern investigate ghost sightings at a village where people have started going missing.\",\"still_path\":\"/ioJWXpvWXAEjK1ues1ZZBwdYOA0.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-10-06\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.167},{\"id\":4698541,\"episode_number\":6,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"The Hero of the Village\",\"overview\":\"Frieren and Fern enlist Stark's help to fight the solar dragon - but is he up to the task?\",\"still_path\":\"/veuq90RbYrizOYc6RWjZHqhf2ii.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-10-13\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.461},{\"id\":4698543,\"episode_number\":7,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Like a Fairy Tale\",\"overview\":\"After reflecting on the transient nature of the past as it exists in people's collective memories, Frieren unexpectedly runs into a sworn enemy.\",\"still_path\":\"/qTS0N4eauUgqa64LVXJoJjfvpo6.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-10-20\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.3},{\"id\":4698544,\"episode_number\":8,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Frieren the Slayer\",\"overview\":\"As tensions in Graf Granat's domain reach a breaking point, Fern and Stark find their own resolve - and Frieren resumes an old duty.\",\"still_path\":\"/6m8vHkqJ8lESCxneLeXPNq5V08f.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-10-27\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.571},{\"id\":4698545,\"episode_number\":9,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Aura the Guillotine\",\"overview\":\"While Fern and Stark make a temporary retreat with Graf Granat, Frieren's true foe awaits her outside the city.\",\"still_path\":\"/yUeaBIwxbsPSri1oVBr2hNXVPYQ.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-11-03\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.514},{\"id\":4698546,\"episode_number\":10,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"A Powerful Mage\",\"overview\":\"Frieren's many years of training under her teacher Flamme are tested in her confrontation with Aura the Guillotine. Will Aura's scales find her wanting?\",\"still_path\":\"/5Sryn4O6eO6bsdWbz30NK84PrnQ.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-11-10\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.571},{\"id\":4698547,\"episode_number\":11,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Winter in the Northern Lands\",\"overview\":\"Frieren and her companions continue their journey through the northern lands, but obstacles both natural and manmade still stand in their way.\",\"still_path\":\"/jUtZqIcrvFhI7XkBA3I1tZtCWDH.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-11-17\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":7.848},{\"id\":4698548,\"episode_number\":12,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"A Real Hero\",\"overview\":\"Deep in the mountains of the northern lands, Frieren and her party arrive at the Village of the Sword, where they have another job to do.\",\"still_path\":\"/4YV6QgyVjXx0KcmPoT535hOhCWv.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-11-24\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.2},{\"id\":4698549,\"episode_number\":13,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Aversion to One's Own Kind\",\"overview\":\"While passing by a village in the woods of the northern lands, Frieren and party meet Sein, a gifted priest who is nonetheless corrupt enough to give even Heiter a run for his money. But what happened in his past?\",\"still_path\":\"/jwkQw81qj1CNYEkW4ukZmK1YePC.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-12-01\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":7.471},{\"id\":4698550,\"episode_number\":14,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Privilege of the Young\",\"overview\":\"The party arrives in a large and lively town with a bustling shopping district that Frieren once visited with Himmel, but something seems to have come up between Fern and Stark.\",\"still_path\":\"/mQEU8qSpVEadU4Dl9j0Wkpfgwuv.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-12-08\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.6},{\"id\":4698551,\"episode_number\":15,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Smells Like Trouble\",\"overview\":\"When the party happens upon a town whose inhabitants are all mysteriously asleep, it's time for their newest traveling companion to prove his mettle.\",\"still_path\":\"/cOfKOSmmgXgvO0Mu2OwlVKsj7hU.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-12-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.303},{\"id\":4698553,\"episode_number\":16,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Long-Lived Friends\",\"overview\":\"Frieren pays a visit to Old Man Voll, a long-lived friend of hers, with traveling companions in tow.\",\"still_path\":\"/k8lmaH6EWTTGiRUKJVWx44Ydhhh.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2023-12-22\",\"runtime\":24,\"vote_average\":7.9},{\"id\":4698554,\"episode_number\":17,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Take Care\",\"overview\":\"Now that Sein finally has a lead on the whereabouts of his long-lost friend, is it time for him and Frieren's party to part ways?\",\"still_path\":\"/2LGPjsA3qfxrQRNyA1Hy2J6pMPY.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-01-05\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.063},{\"id\":4698555,\"episode_number\":18,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"First-Class Mage Exam\",\"overview\":\"Frieren and party finally arrive in Äußerst, ready to undergo the first-class mage exam, and meet a number of colorful characters who are there to do the same.\",\"still_path\":\"/91NiTkE2yWsplPPI8LrjhAqRRfG.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-01-12\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":7.5},{\"id\":4698556,\"episode_number\":19,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Well-Laid Plans\",\"overview\":\"Frieren and her new teammates hatch a plan to capture a Stille - but are the other teams just going to stand by and let it happen?\",\"still_path\":\"/xJKt0TxvyUw9QjTiRNYJXmD5Gl5.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-01-19\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":7.5},{\"id\":4698558,\"episode_number\":20,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Necessary Killing\",\"overview\":\"The first-class mage exam intensifies as fighting breaks out between the participants - and what's at stake might even be worth killing for.\",\"still_path\":\"/8jNWhj11csvsG0wctcSso9phJkF.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-01-26\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.3},{\"id\":4698561,\"episode_number\":21,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"The World of Magic\",\"overview\":\"Frieren, Kanne, and Lawine struggle with the 13th party over possession of the Stille, but there'll be more surprises in store before their battle, and the first test, reach their conclusion.\",\"still_path\":\"/piGXoFe6uSWRqiV1Kv40fJnepGb.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-02-02\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.1},{\"id\":4698563,\"episode_number\":22,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Future Enemies\",\"overview\":\"After the conclusion of the first test, the exam participants have some time to kill in town. What do mages get up to on their days off?\",\"still_path\":\"/xUbTT9y3ZsDh2HEmyQd8UfvNEA1.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-02-09\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":7.5},{\"id\":4698565,\"episode_number\":23,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Conquering the Labyrinth\",\"overview\":\"The aspiring first-class mages now face their second test: conquering the Ruins of the King's Tomb. A simple task, or so the proctor claims, but there's a reason this particular dungeon remains unexplored.\",\"still_path\":\"/tafHSu4qbxNwyRCKFhSBJgtJUhN.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-02-16\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.2},{\"id\":4698570,\"episode_number\":24,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Perfect Replicas\",\"overview\":\"Due to the Spiegel, a legendary monster that can create perfect replicas of others, the test-takers who would conquer the Ruins of the King's Tomb must first face the ultimate enemy: themselves.\",\"still_path\":\"/ynN96chZ1anKjrmeFlkWvHGLK0O.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-02-23\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.3},{\"id\":4810162,\"episode_number\":25,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"A Fatal Vulnerability\",\"overview\":\"A perfect imitation of Frieren stands between the test-takers and victory, but Fern believes she knows how to win. Is it time for the student to surpass the master?\",\"still_path\":\"/t7NXmWJL9a4uyPQuv0vAvPvd5td.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-03-01\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":9.1},{\"id\":4810163,\"episode_number\":26,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"The Height of Magic\",\"overview\":\"To defeat Spiegel, Frieren and Fern fight against Frieren's replica, but have a tough time. Meanwhile, Denken, Lavine, and the others fight against the replicas, but the magic of Sense, a first-class mage and the exam's proctor, rages.\",\"still_path\":\"/kovGQEJxKlJwG0YBvQn4JPLqwtP.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-03-08\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":9.2},{\"id\":4810164,\"episode_number\":27,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"An Era of Humans\",\"overview\":\"With the second test behind them, only one remains - but first, Frieren and Fern need to settle an important matter in town. What awaits them in the third test?\",\"still_path\":\"/gU8G4cvHREYWQa3d0EhUvJSP2T8.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-03-15\",\"runtime\":25,\"vote_average\":8.6},{\"id\":4810165,\"episode_number\":28,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"It Would Be Embarrassing When We Met Again\",\"overview\":\"As the first-class mage exam concludes and the test-takers go their separate ways, farewell leads to departure - but the next stage of Frieren's journey has only just begun.\",\"still_path\":\"/rwVIbR6WXbsslVHcG3t4nvS1T53.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2024-03-22\",\"runtime\":24,\"vote_average\":8.8},{\"id\":6855834,\"episode_number\":29,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Shall We Go, Then?\",\"overview\":\"Frieren, Fern, and Stark leave the magic city of Äußerst behind and travel along a road in the northern lands.\",\"still_path\":\"/a47oBhPll8SzPJaef1VzG0Yft91.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8},{\"id\":6855835,\"episode_number\":30,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"The Hero of the South\",\"overview\":\"In a village in the northern lands, Frieren’s party are hired to polish a statue of a hero.\",\"still_path\":\"/8Cg0I0yprkMkjoTtoho0ogw2kmI.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8.4},{\"id\":6855836,\"episode_number\":31,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Somewhere She'd Like\",\"overview\":\"Frieren’s party dream of hot springs as they reach Etwas, but the village is abandoned.\",\"still_path\":\"/aPX4K7ZtxkKmonWw89NnAAECMNf.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8.2},{\"id\":6855837,\"episode_number\":32,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Other People's Homes\",\"overview\":\"Stark only asked Fern out as a joke, but the two end up going on a date.\",\"still_path\":\"/AntllJyOpKULL4Hv6GlRMn68DpM.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-02-06\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8.2},{\"id\":6855838,\"episode_number\":33,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Logistics in the Northern Plateau\",\"overview\":\"Frieren is reunited with Fass the dwarf, who has been searching for the Boshaft liquor for over 200 years.\",\"still_path\":\"/iVDYCaax4SWVNzaxzNQHqkXKgka.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8.2},{\"id\":6855839,\"episode_number\":34,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"A Demon-Slaying Request\",\"overview\":\"A village on the Northern Plateau is wiped out, and the victims' distinctive wounds point to a certain demon.\",\"still_path\":\"/8dJ80GOvWOSK4NZBwAYShgAk7A2.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-02-27\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8},{\"id\":6855840,\"episode_number\":35,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"The Divine Revolte\",\"overview\":\"Frieren, Fern, and Methode enter the woods to look for the four-armed Divine Revolte.\",\"still_path\":\"/wxaQNUUhaRHiNNgEY236WUenB27.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-03-06\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8.7},{\"id\":6855841,\"episode_number\":36,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"A Magnificent End\",\"overview\":\"The Divine Revolte appears at the village, while Frieren, Fern, and Methode battle Solide and Hemmung.\",\"still_path\":\"/sAWooNnmHju9d2CVCpQQTRlSUyt.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-03-13\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":9.5},{\"id\":6855842,\"episode_number\":37,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"Himmel's Memoirs\",\"overview\":\"When Frieren's party cannot afford the fare to cross Lake Korridor, the captain proposes a trade.\",\"still_path\":\"/vvAKf0pGpPBGkOJlnU8yoe5BXkp.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-03-20\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":8.8},{\"id\":6855843,\"episode_number\":38,\"season_number\":1,\"name\":\"A Beautiful Sight\",\"overview\":\"Hidden within the massive bridge spanning the Great Canyon Tor is a secret story of Himmel and Gehen.\",\"still_path\":\"/l5eb222ZEemkCyoaYbzdHUwxptG.jpg\",\"air_date\":\"2026-03-27\",\"runtime\":23,\"vote_average\":9}]}"
          },
